From 6f3ff1417f55be6b3589f4c1c9a67f6ab2a41ba9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Scott Hanan (t2 executor)" <t3exec@t2.tailc9b568.ts.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 06:27:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 15/17] fix(server): self-update handoff behind a durable
 hub-hold barrier (#303)

Independent review NO-GO blocker: the guard ignored pending non-holdable
effects and checked counts separately from the handoff. Every update path now
sets the hub hold (actor self-update) before counting, refuses unless queued,
in-flight, outbox-pending and claimed are all zero, and clears a hold it set
on refusal or a failed handoff. After a handoff the hold stays set across the
restart until an operator clears it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/server/src/cloud/selfUpdate.test.ts | 68 +++++++++++++++--
 apps/server/src/cloud/selfUpdate.ts      | 94 +++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 38 deletions(-)

diff --git a/apps/server/src/cloud/selfUpdate.test.ts b/apps/server/src/cloud/selfUpdate.test.ts
